codex
The cause is now concrete: this sandbox exposes `/proc/self/exe` but not `/proc/<current-namespace-pid>/exe`; Lean 4.22 uses the latter to locate its application, which also prevents Lake from discovering its installation. I’m applying a narrow, auditable runtime shim only in `/tmp/audit-work` that redirects that one executable-path lookup to `/proc/self/exe`, then I’ll rerun the unchanged trusted preflight and record both the shim source and results.
